Third-party notices
===================

The skills-manager package does not bundle node_modules. npm installs the
following direct runtime dependencies separately, together with their own
license files and their dependencies' notices:

- @opentui/core 0.5.11 and its platform-specific native package: MIT
- execa 9.6.1: MIT
- skills 1.7.6: MIT
- yaml 2.8.4: ISC

The skills 1.7.6 package includes additional third-party material and its
ThirdPartyNoticeText.txt contains the corresponding notices. OpenTUI native
packages contain additional LICENSE-* files for their native components.
These files are part of the respective dependency distributions and must be
retained when redistributing them. Transitive dependencies carry their own
licenses in their installed packages.

